This product is a 100% local, privacy-focused speech-to-text Windows application designed for low-latency dictation.

Key Characteristics:
- Windows-Only: Utilizes native Windows APIs (WASAPI / Win32 Global Hotkeys / Win32 Input Injection).
- 100% Offline & Local: All speech recognition model inference runs on-device using local weights. No audio, transcripts, or telemetry are transmitted to any cloud services.
- Permissive Licensing: All codebase components and integrated dependencies comply with non-copyleft open-source licenses (MIT/Apache-2.0/BSD).
